WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.7 · Financial Management
Management accounts and budget versus actual

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Compare actual with budget regularly, explain the gaps and decide what to do.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Show budget, actual and variance for each line.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Explain big variances: timing, price or volume.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Forecast where you will end the year.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: shop sales £9,000 under budget; profit forecast £19,000, not £25,000; trustees plan charity savings.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You design your monthly report and review routine.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
